	<element name="Moonstone of Aranthor" type="Magic Item" source="Homebrew" id="ID_SPOONY_HB_MAGIC_ITEM_MOONSTONE_OF_ARANTHOR">
		<description>
			<p>A powerful artifact. Grants Drakvision 120ft, increases Armor Class by 1, and once per long rest you can turn ethereal for 1 minute.</p>
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="keywords">Ethereal</set>
			<set name="category">Homebrew Items</set>
			<set name="cost" currency="gp">0</set>
			<set name="weight" lb="0">0 lb.</set>
			<set name="slot">neck</set>
			<set name="type">Homebrew Item</set>
			<set name="armorClass">+1</set>
			<set name="attunement">true</set>
			<set name="rarity">Legendary</set>
		</setters>
		<rules>
			<stat name="ac:misc" value="1" />
			<grant type="Vision" id="ID_VISION_LESSER_DARKVISION" />
		</rules>
	</element>
	<element name="Ravenleaf Bulwark" type="Magic Item" source="Homebrew" id="ID_SPOONY_HB_ARMOR_RAVENLEAF_BULWARK">
		<description>
			<p>While holding this shield, you gain a +1 bonus to wisdom.</p>
			<p class="indent"><strong><em>Oak Father's Wrath (3/long rest): </em></strong>Once per turn, as an action or bonus action, you call upon the ancient will of the wild. Grasping vines and roots erupt from the ground beneath a creature within 20 feet. The Target must succeed on a DC 13 Strength saving throw or be restrained until the end of its next turn.</p>
			<p class="indent"><strong><em>Matron's Retribution (3/long rest): </em></strong>When a creature misses you with a melee attack, you can use your reaction to unleash forceful unseen energy. The attacker takes 3d6 force damage and must succeed on a DC 15 Strength saving throw or be pushed 10 feet away. On a success, it takes half damage and isn't pushed.</p> 
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="keywords">shield</set>
			<set name="category">Homebrew Items</set>
			<set name="cost" currency="gp">0</set>
			<set name="weight" lb="0">0 lb.</set>
			<set name="slot">onehand,secondary</set>
			<set name="type" addition="shield">Armor</set>
			<set name="armor">ID_INTERNAL_ARMOR_GROUP_SHIELD</set>
			<set name="armorClass">+2</set>
			<set name="proficiency">ID_PROFICIENCY_ARMOR_PROFICIENCY_SHIELD</set>
			<set name="attunement">true</set>
			<set name="rarity">Very Rare</set>
		</setters>
		<rules>
			<stat name="ac:shield" value="2" bonus="shield" />
			<grant type="Ability Score Improvement" id="ID_INTERNAL_ASI_WISDOM" />
		</rules>		
	</element>
	<element name="Mantle of the Dusk Wanderer" type="Magic Item" source="Homebrew" id="ID_SPOONY_HB_MAGIC_ITEM_MANTLE_OF_THE_DUSK_WANDERER">
		<description>
			<p>While wearing this mantle, heavy armor doesn't impose disadvantage on your Dexterity (Stealth) checks.</p>
			<p class="indent">Once per long rest, when you fall, you can use your reaction to spread the mantle. For the duration of the fall: you descend as though affected by a feather fall spell, and while descending, you can move up to 20 feet horizontally.</p>
			<p class="indent">At night, you have advantage on all Survival checks.</p>
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="keywords">saving throw</set>
			<set name="category">Homebrew Items</set>
			<set name="cost" currency="gp">0</set>
			<set name="weight" lb="0">0 lb.</set>
			<set name="slot">shoulders</set>
			<set name="type">Wondrous Item</set>
			<set name="attunement">true</set>
			<set name="rarity">Rare</set>
		</setters>
	</element>
	<element name="Kethril's Lucky Coin" type="Magic Item" source="Homebrew" id="ID_SPOONY_HB_MAGIC_ITEM_KETHRILS_LUCKY_COIN">
		<description>
			<p>At the start of combat, you can flip this coin. (Roll a d20) The result of the flip determines the benefit.</p>
			<p class="indent"><strong><em>Blade (Heads/1-10): </em></strong>You gain advantage on your next attack roll.</p>
			<p class="indent"><strong><em>Guard (Tails/11-20): </em></strong>You gain advantage on your next saving throw.</p>
			<p class="indent">Additionally, you may use this item as a bonus action once per short rest.</p>
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="category">Homebrew Items</set>
			<set name="type">Wondrous Item</set>
			<set name="rarity">Rare</set>
		</setters>
	</element>
	<element name="Oathbrand Longsword" type="Magic Item" source="Homebrew" id="ID_SPOONY_HB_MAGIC_ITEM_OATHBRAND_LONGSWORD">
		<supports>ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_CATEGORY_MARTIAL_MELEE, ID_INTERNAL_DAMAGE_TYPE_SLASHING, ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_PROPERTY_VERSATILE, ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_GROUP_SWORDS</supports>
		<description>
			<p><strong><em>Special Quality: </em></strong>Counts as magical and silvered.</p>
			<p><strong><em>Sanctified Stand (1/Short rest): </em></strong>As an Action or Bonus Action, you raise the blade skyward, until the start of your next turn: You and all allies within 10ft. gain +2AC. You cannot attack or move while channeling this ability.</p>
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="keywords">Longsword</set>
			<set name="category">Homebrew Items</set>
			<set name="cost" currency="gp">0</set>
			<set name="type" addition="longsword">Weapon</set>
			<set name="rarity">Rare</set>
			<set name="slot">onehand</set>
			<set name="damage" type="slashing">1d8</set>
			<set name="versatile">1d10</set>
			<set name="weapon">Longsword</set>
			<set name="enhancement">1</set>
			<set name="proficiency">ID_PROFICIENCY_WEAPON_PROFICIENCY_LONGSWORD</set>
		</setters>
	</element>
	<element name="Thorn of the Fallen Grove" type="Magic Item" source="Homebrew" id="ID_SPOONY_HB_MAGIC_ITEM_THORN_OF_THE_FALEN_GROVE">
		<supports>ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_CATEGORY_SIMPLE_MELEE, ID_INTERNAL_DAMAGE_TYPE_PIERCING, ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_PROPERTY_FINESSE, ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_PROPERTY_LIGHT, ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_PROPERTY_THROWN</supports>
		<description>
			<p><strong><em>Hollowstep Tempo: </em></strong>When you make the extra attack of the <em>Light</em> property, you can make it as part of the <strong>Attack action </strong>instead of as a <strong>Bonus Action</strong>. You can make this extra attack only once per turn.</p>
			<p><strong><em>Mycelial Blade: </em></strong>Once per turn, when you deal <strong>Sneak Attack damage</strong>, you deal an additional <strong>1d6 Necrotic damage</strong>.</p>
			<p class="indent">If the target is poisoned, it takes an additional <strong>1d6 Necrotic damage</strong>.</p>
			<p><strong><em>Primeval Veil (1/Short Rest): </em></strong>As a <strong>Bonus Action</strong>, you dissolve into a swirling veil of spores, leaves, and shadow, teleporting up to <strong>30 feet</strong> to an unoccupied space you can see.</p>
			<p class="indent">Until the start of your next turn Attack rolls against you have disadvantage and this movement does not provoke <strong>Opportunity Attacks</strong>.</p>
			<p><strong><em>Venom Strike (1/Long Rest): </em></strong>As a <strong>Bonus Action</strong>, you cause dark, resinous sap to seep from the blade, coating it in toxic venom. The next time you hit a creature, it must succeed on a <strong>DC 16 Constitution saving throw</strong> or take <strong>4d6 Poison damage</strong> and becomes <strong>poisoned for 1 minute</strong>. On a success it takes half damage and is not poisoned. A poisoned creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success.</p>
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="keywords">dagger</set>
			<set name="category">Homebrew Items</set>
			<set name="cost" currency="gp">0</set>
			<set name="type" addition="dagger">Weapon</set>
			<set name="slot">onehand</set>
			<set name="damage" type="piercing">1d4</set>
			<set name="rarity">Rare</set>
			<set name="enhancement">1</set>
			<set name="weapon">ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_CATEGORY_SIMPLE_MELEE||ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_CATEGORY_SIMPLE_RANGED||ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_CATEGORY_MARTIAL_MELEE||ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_CATEGORY_MARTIAL_RANGED</set>
		</setters>
	</element>
	<element name="Skyfall" type="Magic Item" source="Homebrew" id="ID_SPOONY_HB_MAGIC_ITEM_SKYFALL">
		<supports>ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_CATEGORY_MARTIAL_MELEE, ID_INTERNAL_DAMAGE_TYPE_PIERCING</supports>
		<description>
			<p><strong><em>Fallen Star Core:</em> Once on each of your turns</strong>, when you hit a creature with Skyfall, the weapon erupts with celestial energy, dealing an additional <strong>1d6 Radiant damage</strong>.</p>
			<p class="indent"><strong><em>Arcane Convergence:</em></strong> When you cast a spell of <strong>1st level or higher, Until the end of your next turn</strong>, the next time you hit a creature with Skyfall, the extra damage from <strong>Fallen Star Core</strong> also deals an additional <strong>1d8 Fire, Cold, Lighting, or Thunder damage (your choice)</strong>.</p>
			<p class="indent"><strong><em>Vengeful Flare:</em></strong> When you miss with an attack using Skyfall, celestial fragments scrape across your foe before reforming into the weapon. The target takes <strong>Radiant damage</strong> equal to your <strong>Strength modifier</strong>.</p>
			<p class="indent"><strong><em>Heaven's Descent (1/Short Rest):</em></strong> As a <strong>Bonus Action</strong>, you can cause Skyfall to fracture into celestial shards that streak twords a distant foe before reforming in your grasp. Until the <strong>end of your next turn</strong>, you can make <strong>one attack</strong> with Skyfall against a creature <strong>within 30 feet</strong>.</p>
			<p class="indent"><strong><em>Skyward Strike (1/Long Rest):</em></strong> When you hit a creature with Skyfall, you can unleash the star's latent power. The attack deals an additional <strong>3d8 Radiant damage</strong>, and the target must succeed on a <strong>DC 14 Constitution saving throw</strong> or be <strong>blinded until the end of your next turn</strong>.</p>
		</description>
		<setters>
			<set name="keywords">morningstar</set>
			<set name="category">Homebrew Items</set>
			<set name="cost" currency="gp">0</set>
			<set name="weight" lb="0">0 lb.</set>
			<set name="type" addition="morningstar">Weapon</set>
			<set name="rarity">Very Rare</set>
			<set name="slot">onehand</set>
			<set name="damage" type="piercing">1d8</set>
			<set name="enhancement">1</set>
			<set name="weapon">ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_CATEGORY_SIMPLE_MELEE||ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_CATEGORY_SIMPLE_RANGED||ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_CATEGORY_MARTIAL_MELEE||ID_INTERNAL_WEAPON_CATEGORY_MARTIAL_RANGED</set>
			<set name="proficiency">ID_PROFICIENCY_WEAPON_PROFICIENCY_MORNINGSTAR</set>
		</setters>
	</element>
